OL,3,GNEWSARescued puffin named during visit
OL,4,Ato supermarket
OL,5,
OL,6,FA puffin rescued after being found weak
OL,7,Fand underweight on a Cornwall beach has
OL,8,Fsettled into a new home.
OL,10,FMorris, who was discovered at Hawkes
OL,11,FPoint near St Ives, has joined the
OL,12,Fpuffin colony at at the Cornish Seal
OL,13,FSanctuary in Gweek.
OL,15,FLocal bird rehabilitation specialist
OL,16,FJon Matthews, who cared for her while
OL,17,Fshe recovered, said: "We feel genuinely
OL,18,Fgrateful that we were able to share so
OL,19,Fmuch time with such a gorgeous bird."
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
