OL,3,GNEWSARescued puffin named during visit
OL,4,Ato supermarket
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe bird got her name after being
OL,7,Frescued when Matthews stopped at
OL,8,FMorrisons in Penzance to buy whitebait
OL,9,Fand a fishmonger helped feed the puffin
OL,10,Fin the car park. The bird was
OL,11,Fchristened Morris and despite DNA
OL,12,Ftesting revealing Morris was female,
OL,13,Fthe name remained.
